{"lines":[{"y":0.036064098378364107,"x":0.68123319876301325,"t":"Sample Writing answers","w":0.22973897298177082,"h":0.019084664222978831,"c":1},{"x":0.077669902199341861,"c":1,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 2","y":0.087209302181375015,"w":0.35922330220540355,"h":0.021824965670101393},{"y":0.12645348825918912,"c":1,"w":0.80582524617513018,"h":0.017471745452405485,"x":0.077669901076433803,"t":"This model has been prepared by an examiner as an example of a very good answer."},{"h":0.022832289365964487,"y":0.15394007103933494,"w":0.80788213094075534,"c":1,"t":"Statistics show that the world's population is increasing rapidly. It is expected that most of us will","x":0.077623871614188433},{"w":0.82330098470052082,"c":1,"h":0.020389590159383575,"x":0.077669895924745255,"y":0.17587209248632729,"t":"be living in cities within the next few decades. The question of whether urbanisation is a positive or"},{"c":1,"x":0.077456072636769971,"t":"negative development remains controversial.","y":0.19657326186067337,"w":0.37314135233561196,"h":0.021733395110038245},{"x":0.077669928928568582,"w":0.79223297119140623,"c":1,"t":"A rapid influx of people moving from rural to urban areas is bound to cause problems. Firstly,","h":0.020348835882739502,"y":0.22674418650630468},{"x":0.077669893261520045,"y":0.24854651109824666,"h":0.020348838259497959,"c":1,"w":0.80388351440429684,"t":"pressure on resources such as housing and transportation intensifies. It is becoming difficult for"},{"c":1,"y":0.27034883668096432,"h":0.020348838259497848,"t":"many people to afford adequate housing in cities. A by-product of this is the creation of slums","x":0.077669896660199619,"w":0.79223302205403645},{"t":"causing low-income tamilies to group together in neglected parts of the city. These people often","y":0.29078027909395809,"h":0.02306063643125722,"c":1,"x":0.077581317526565483,"w":0.80017695109049491},{"c":1,"y":0.31395348864389616,"t":"become trapped in a cycle of poverty that is difficult to escape.","x":0.077669907724574092,"w":0.52621358235677085,"h":0.018895348284474811},{"h":0.021939071465132742,"t":"As mentioned above, the growth of urban areas can also lead to severe traffic congestion because","x":0.077669907682968553,"y":0.34143302168003631,"w":0.81359222412109389,"c":1},{"y":0.36479750799275346,"h":0.019003115264797366,"c":1,"x":0.07766991244927994,"w":0.79611648559570303,"t":"more and more vehicles travel into the city from the suburbs. This has many knock-on effects,"},{"t":"such as problems with air quality. It also leads many city dwellers to experience mental health","c":1,"w":0.78079381306966145,"x":0.077577171945060669,"y":0.38499762300248774,"h":0.022901782217055522},{"y":0.40841121439649908,"x":0.075728159450522178,"w":0.55728154500325533,"t":"issues because travelling across large cities is tiring and stressful.","h":0.020367855892003073,"c":1},{"x":0.079611654835269219,"y":0.43738317704043328,"c":1,"t":"All of this being said, I don't believe that urbanisation is a wholly negative development. There are","w":0.81359222412109378,"h":0.020560747663551315},{"h":0.022674211163387192,"c":1,"w":0.79238622029622396,"x":0.077598522002253867,"t":"advantages to living in large cities that are well managed. For example, there are more schools","y":0.45837099419620764},{"w":0.79624699910481778,"t":"which means more education opportunities. Access to higher-quality health care is often better","h":0.022148015863056147,"y":0.48053333824025068,"c":1,"x":0.077609556282050018},{"t":"in cities. Some cities have also introduced ride-sharing, e-bikes and park and ride services that","h":0.020560747663551426,"c":1,"w":0.80582524617513018,"x":0.077669901094927149,"y":0.50280373814914148},{"y":0.52461059165665147,"w":0.2737864176432292,"h":0.019003115264797588,"c":1,"t":"reduce environmental problems.","x":0.077669897865728116},{"w":0.83106796264648419,"c":1,"t":"My opinion is that many of the problems associated with urbanisation are avoidable but dealing with","h":0.020364232523790382,"x":0.079611649681226873,"y":0.55377906923911402},{"x":0.077669903851701555,"w":0.82524271647135417,"c":1,"y":0.57558139481946446,"t":"increasing populations in cities is a formidable challenge. How governments, businesses and society","h":0.020368761436961536},{"w":0.60970876057942702,"h":0.020373289161753405,"c":1,"y":0.597383720401514,"x":0.077669891467187904,"t":"respond to this challenge will dramatically atfect the future of our world."},{"h":0.017385586771266892,"w":0.41377006530761717,"t":"Here are comments from another examiner:","c":1,"y":0.63381231114837444,"x":0.079536382308960471},{"t":"This response addresses both sides of the question and presents a position, that","y":0.67151162779257101,"h":0.017584945702478483,"x":0.12621360429574632,"w":0.75922327677408863,"c":1},{"t":"the movement to cities is not a [wholly negative development]. The second and","c":1,"x":0.12427184439781058,"w":0.74368932088216144,"h":0.01750615794339283,"y":0.69034267937224336},{"y":0.7078198803686051,"c":1,"w":0.73216557820638017,"x":0.12421509512891267,"h":0.019020835187204876,"t":"third paragraphs lay out the problems that can be caused by a [rapid influx] of"},{"t":"people to urban areas [housing | transportation | traffic congestion] and the fourth","h":0.017492574174827413,"c":1,"y":0.72674418593218937,"w":0.76310679117838554,"x":0.12427184707923923},{"h":0.01744186068621012,"t":"paragraph presents some of the advantages [education opportunities | higher-","c":1,"x":0.12427183835554047,"y":0.74563953476517308,"w":0.73592234293619796},{"c":1,"t":"quality health care | environmental transport initiatives].","w":0.52053848266601555,"x":0.12614571021933435,"y":0.76317162193967447,"h":0.020309269985305911},{"c":1,"x":0.12616735774833843,"t":"However, the part of the question about 'the population in the countryside ...","h":0.019223007012007742,"y":0.80074709328177307,"w":0.71270258585611979},{"w":0.77087376912434891,"h":0.017583134018372193,"t":"decreasing' is not covered. The candidate would need to include it to provide a full","x":0.12621360078954921,"y":0.81962616841514502,"c":1},{"w":0.22718447367350264,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"answer to this question.","c":1,"x":0.12621358978460789,"y":0.84011627900661234},{"w":0.7339805603027344,"c":1,"t":"Information and ideas are logically organised and there is a clear progression,","y":0.87632398760496177,"x":0.12427185569575443,"h":0.01757136133972359},{"w":0.63883494059244794,"t":"starting with the challenges and ending with a range of advantages.","x":0.12427185018669121,"y":0.89532710282004913,"h":0.017463594953590511,"c":1},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"x":0.87572815595257303,"t":"133","y":0.95348837197163838}],"w":2400,"h":3209}